# scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/ is an allowlist: the folder accumulates one-off
# Blender probes written to chase a single artifact (a smeared weight, a dark
# vertex, a bad viseme) and heavy derived output — GLB iterations and QA render
# sheets, ~1.4 GB at its peak. Those stay on disk for whoever is mid-investigation
# but never enter the repo. Only the tools that still apply to the current
# designer-rigged avatar are tracked.
scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/*
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/README.md
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/fix_avatar_morphs.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/add_hair_bones.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/remove_zfight_layer.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/fix_rig_scale.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/fix_skirt_weights.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/diag_skirt_weights.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/diag_morphs.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/diag_morph_distinct.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/diag_hair_bones.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/probe_glb.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/probe_hair.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/probe_beads.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/qa_render.py
!scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/soften_dress_texture.py

# NOTE: MANGLARIASK.glb (Manglara, the foundation's own character) IS committed
# so the deployed app can serve it (avatar 404'd in prod otherwise). If you move
# it to a CDN, set VITE_AVATAR_URL instead and re-add the ignore below.
